sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Mobile as Android App
    participant MobileAPI as Mobile API
    participant DB as BRaVe DB
    participant SB as Azure Service Bus (Queue)
    participant Dedupe as Deduplication Service
    participant Match as Matching Server

    Mobile->>MobileAPI: Push beneficiary + biometric payload
    MobileAPI->>DB: Write/Update records
    alt biometric present
        MobileAPI-->>SB: Publish job message (biometric dedupe needed)
        Dedupe->>SB: Dequeue job message
        Dedupe->>DB: Fetch biometric data (by job/beneficiary ids)
        Dedupe->>Match: Send processed biometric payload for duplication check
        Match-->>Dedupe: Return match result (duplicate/no-duplicate + scores)
        Dedupe->>DB: Update dedupe status + results
    else no biometric
        MobileAPI-->>Mobile: Ack saved (no dedupe job)
    end
